Both the primary create-page factory
`e4c8222fbd38de2011af5d28071baeebbd3a4edbe1ffb4f328c42e4fae66c2ac`
and edit-route variant
`39d30f8edb4cb5d68177bb88384b9b96c33e51867925721bdf91f49d592b07bb`
