card lists remain `unknown`: curated module 52644 consumes `sets`, `allSets`,
and
`numSets`, but the server origin of those props is not present in the curated
client chunks, so visible card count is not promoted to full-account truth.

Recovered My Sets module 52644 renders each set as an article with a title and
Edit link, and separately renders the exact no-sets heading and Create a Set
action. The browser now requires on-screen geometry for the main My Sets
heading, every listed article/title/Edit link, and both empty-account controls.
Missing, hidden, or duplicate empty-account evidence fails instead of granting
`complete`.

Concealed article controls likewise cannot become observational
set rows. These are DOM visibility bounds, not a nonempty server pagination
