The unpacked extension compiles with the pinned repository compiler and is
included in native package resources. Synthetic worker tests cover trusted popup
senders, exact loopback configuration, bounded replies, navigation, unsupported
commands, and signed-out page stops. Artifact tests verify emitted JavaScript
imports and the narrow permission set, with no server/secret modules.

Recovered dashboard HTML and module 88289 confirm a visible modal headed "Select
your organization". Session observation now treats that exact visible dialog as
organization-prompt, and set reads stop while it is present. The adapter does
